  "title": "The Rise of Power at the 2025 OCP Global Summit",
  "summary": "The OCP Global Summit has grown to become one of the major conferences for the Artificial Intelligence (AI) Data Center market. This year’s event attracted over 10,000 attendees. The keynotes were hosted in a massive tent with thousands of people in attendance. At times, it felt more like Coachella than a tech conference, with high-profile presenters showcasing the industry's advances in AI to the audience (fans). These advancements are music to our ears, and we can’t wait to see the breakthroughs our industry will achieve to further advance our collective goal towards this AI revolution.",
